Linking renames struct A and struct S of one of the two files. The anonymous
union nested in struct S depends on struct A and is thus renamed as well, which
here yields the same name, which must keep the naming convention for anonymous
tag types for the symbol table to be well formed. incomplete.desc makes the
new name of the union differ from its old one.
